 [; I1 row 9 (audit C4/L78, DEFINES): quoted trees LOWER to plain
    authorable CX text — a bare $x binding becomes the variable hole
    `$x` — so quote → serialize → hash yields a real Tier-1 address
    (pre-I1 the cx:-namespaced image died on re-parse, E210→CXER4100;
    the pre-fix pin recorded that death). Expression identity IS the
    Tier-1 address of the lowered tree (L77/L81): the digest below
    EQUALS `cx hash` of the data document `[total $x]`. ]
 [case id=cx-094-quote-hash-is-tier1 level=core
  [tags cx quote hash lowering c4 i1]
  [in-cx [#
[empty]
#]]
  [in-code [#
[?let [= $q [?quote [total $x]]] [$cx:hash [$cx:serialize $q]]]
#]]
  [out-text [#
'sha2-256:cf1204b421c2179448e1fe82338d37e64998a1897ea67d8c27674204ebf2c5a0'
#]]
 ]

 [; stream-2 L93 (W4): the PLAN ADDRESS is the caching-identity tier
